+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                               qslice.pd — Object Mapping                             |
|                     Moderation • Slicing • Closure • Evaluation                      |
+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
Slice definition → Pd list/table/text objects
Moderation rules → Pd filters, math, and shaping objects
Boundary conditions → Pd clamping, wrapping, reflection logic
Slice instance → Pd state containers + evaluation objects
Moderator → Pd control‑rate orchestration
Q state → shared container for RME integration

Q_SLICE_DEFINITION  (criteria, weights, slice template)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[list]               — holds slice criteria and weights
[route]              — dispatch slice parameters
[pack]/[unpack]      — build slice tuples (criteria, weight, id)
[text]               — store slice definitions
[select]             — detect slice type / mode
[expr]               — compute slice weighting logic

Q_MODERATION_RULES  (dampen, amplify, shape)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[lop~]               — low‑pass moderation (dampen high tension)
[hip~]               — high‑pass moderation (amplify high tension)
[expr~]              — custom moderation curves
[*~]                 — scale moderation strength
[clip~]              — enforce moderation bounds
[spigot]             — gate moderation based on criteria
[wrap~]              — cyclic moderation behavior

Q_BOUNDARY_CONDITIONS  (closure, clamping, reflection)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[clip~]              — clamp slice values to boundaries
[expr~]              — compute boundary logic (upper/lower)
[wrap~]              — wrap values cyclically
[reflect~]           — reflect values at boundaries
[select]             — detect boundary violations
[spigot]             — enable/disable closure logic

Q_SLICE_INSTANCE  (actual moderated slice)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[snapshot~]          — convert audio‑rate moderation to control‑rate
[env~]               — measure slice energy
[list store]         — store moderated slice values
[text]               — store slice metadata
[tabwrite]           — write slice values into tables
[tabread]            — read slice values for RME

Q_MASTER_MODERATOR  (orchestrator)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[trigger]            — enforce deterministic ordering (t b f)
[metro]              — drive slice updates
[bang]               — discrete moderation step
[expr]               — control‑rate evaluation logic
[list]               — pass slice parameters
[pack]/[unpack]      — build slice tuples
[text]               — store slice metadata

Q_STATE  (shared state container)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[text]               — store slice definition + moderated slice
[list store]         — maintain evolving slice lists
[tabwrite]           — write slice values into tables
[tabread]            — read slice values for RDG/MFE/RME modules

FLOW (inside qslice.pd)
------------------------------------------------------------------
[SYSTEM_init]
    |
    v
[Q_SLICE_DEFINITION] --> [Q_MODERATION_RULES] --> [Q_BOUNDARY_CONDITIONS]
    |                           |                           |
    v                           v                           v
                        [Q_SLICE_INSTANCE]
                               |
                               v
                           [Q_STATE]

